// M3-B07 redstone parity corpus — replacement entry R2 (Clock).
// MAX_TICKS=200 leaves only a narrow margin over RESTART_DELAY=160 (blueprint Context,
// "Rates and limits"), so the toggle phase below finishes by tick 20, leaving 170 ticks
// to observe the relight.
